---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import '../../styles/servicios.css';
---

<Layout title="Social Media Manager & Branding | Kaptativa" description="Gestión premium de redes sociales y branding corporativo. Creamos estrategias de contenido, diseño y copywriting persuasivo para LinkedIn e Instagram.">
  <Header slot="header" floating />
  
  <main class="servicio-page">
    <!-- HERO INMERSIVO -->
    <section class="hero hero-section" id="inicio">
      <div class="hero-glow-1"></div>
      <div class="hero-glow-2"></div>
      
      <div class="container hero-container">
        <div class="hero-content reveal">
          <h1 class="hero-tagline">Social Media & Branding <span class="text-gradient-cyan">para marcas con autoridad</span></h1>
          <p class="hero-description">Dejá de publicar por publicar. Creamos estrategias de contenido premium y gestionamos tus perfiles de LinkedIn e Instagram con diseño internacional y copywriting persuasivo para posicionarte como líder indiscutido de tu sector.</p>
          
          <div class="hero-buttons">
            <a href="/contacto/" class="btn btn-primary btn-glow">Solicitar demo</a>
            <a href="https://wa.me/5493804890834?text=Hola!%20Quiero%20posicionar%20las%20redes%20sociales%20de%20mi%20empresa%20con%20Kaptativa." target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-secondary btn-whatsapp">
              Escribinos por WhatsApp
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- RESULTADOS (MÉTRICAS) -->
    <section class="section-metrics reveal">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="metrics-grid-premium">
          <div class="metric-card-glass">
            <span class="metric-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"/></svg></span>
            <div class="metric-value">100%</div>
            <div class="metric-label">Contenido original a medida</div>
          </div>
          <div class="metric-card-glass">
            <span class="metric-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M8 2v4"/><path d="M16 2v4"/><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="4" rx="2"/><path d="M3 10h18"/></svg></span>
            <div class="metric-value long">Calendario</div>
            <div class="metric-label">Planificación mensual de contenidos</div>
          </div>
          <div class="metric-card-glass">
            <span class="metric-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"/></svg></span>
            <div class="metric-value">0%</div>
            <div class="metric-label">Plantillas genéricas repetidas</div>
          </div>
          <div class="metric-card-glass">
            <span class="metric-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg></span>
            <div class="metric-value long">LinkedIn</div>
            <div class="metric-label">e Instagram premium</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- LO QUE IMPORTA (EL DOLOR VS LA SOLUCIÓN) -->
    <section class="section" id="lo-que-importa">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header reveal">
          <h2>Estatus de marca frente a likes vacíos</h2>
          <p>Tener miles de seguidores no sirve de nada si tu bandeja de entrada está vacía. Un diseño descuidado y textos genéricos devalúan tu producto o servicio.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="comparison-grid">
          <!-- El problema -->
          <div class="comp-card-bad reveal">
            <div class="comp-card-header">
              <div class="comp-icon-box bad-box"><svg class="glyph" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12"/></svg></div>
              <h3>Community management clásico</h3>
            </div>
            <ul class="comp-list">
              <li><span><svg class="glyph" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12"/></svg></span> Diseños genéricos en Canva que se ven idénticos a los de tu competencia.</li>
              <li><span><svg class="glyph" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12"/></svg></span> Textos aburridos que solo dicen "Escribinos por mensaje directo para más info".</li>
              <li><span><svg class="glyph" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12"/></svg></span> Publicar por cumplir una grilla sin entender el modelo de negocio.</li>
              <li><span><svg class="glyph" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12"/></svg></span> Cero estrategia de conversión: likes de usuarios que jamás comprarán tu servicio.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <!-- La solución -->
          <div class="comp-card-good reveal">
            <div class="comp-card-header">
              <div class="comp-icon-box good-box"><svg class="glyph" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></div>
              <h3>Social media y branding premium</h3>
            </div>
            <ul class="comp-list">
              <li><span><svg class="glyph" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span> Identidad visual exclusiva y diseño de alta calidad alineado a tu marca.</li>
              <li><span><svg class="glyph" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span> Copywriting persuasivo y estratégico redactado por profesionales senior.</li>
              <li><span><svg class="glyph" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span> Contenidos enfocados a generar estatus, educar al mercado y atraer clientes.</li>
              <li><span><svg class="glyph" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span> Informes orientados a consultas reales iniciadas en tu negocio.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- LO QUE INCLUYE (PILARES) -->
    <section class="section section-dark" id="lo-que-incluye">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header reveal">
          <h2>Estrategia integral de social media y branding</h2>
          <p>Nos ocupamos del proceso completo para que tus redes funcionen como un canal de venta y atracción activo.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="pillars-grid">
          <!-- Pilar 1 -->
          <div class="glass-card-premium reveal">
            <div class="pillar-icon">
              <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><polygon points="16.24 7.76 14.12 14.12 7.76 16.24 9.88 9.88 16.24 7.76"></polygon></svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Estrategia y planificación</h3>
            <p>Mapeamos los dolores y aspiraciones de tu cliente ideal para estructurar pilares de contenido orientados a la autoridad digital.</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Pilar 2 -->
          <div class="glass-card-premium reveal" style="justify-content: space-between; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
            <div>
              <div class="pillar-icon">
                <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22C17.5228 22 22 17.5228 22 12C22 6.47715 17.5228 2 12 2C6.47715 2 2 6.47715 2 12C2 14.7255 3.09032 17.1962 4.85857 19C4.85857 19 4.5 20 5.5 21C6.5 22 8 21 8 21C9.19624 21.6377 10.5564 22 12 22Z"></path><circle cx="7.5" cy="10.5" r="1.5"></circle><circle cx="11.5" cy="7.5" r="1.5"></circle><circle cx="16.5" cy="9.5" r="1.5"></circle></svg>
              </div>
              <h3>Diseño visual exclusivo</h3>
              <p>Creamos assets gráficos y recursos premium de alto impacto estético, alineados a la altura del precio de tu producto o servicio.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- Instagram Carousel Mockup -->
            <div class="mock-instagram-widget" style="margin-top: 20px; background: rgba(15, 15, 25, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06); border-radius: 12px; padding: 12px; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;">
              <!-- Header: Profile -->
              <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;">
                <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
                  <div style="width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--gradient-primary); padding: 1.5px; box-sizing: border-box;">
                    <div style="width: 100%; height: 100%; border-radius: 50%; background: #0F0F12; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 0.5rem; color: #ffffff; font-weight: 600;">K</div>
                  </div>
                  <div style="text-align: left;">
                    <div style="font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 600; color: #ffffff; line-height: 1;">kaptativa</div>
                    <div style="font-size: 0.55rem; color: #8E8E99; line-height: 1;">Branding de Autoridad</div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <span style="color: #8E8E99; font-size: 0.8rem; cursor: pointer;">•••</span>
              </div>
              <!-- Post Image/Content -->
              <div style="width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 1; border-radius: 8px; background: radial-gradient(circle at top left, #1B1B20 0%, #0F0F12 100%); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03); display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; padding: 16px; box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; overflow: hidden;">
                <!-- Decorative brand elements -->
                <div style="position: absolute; top: -20px; right: -20px; width: 80px; height: 80px; background: var(--brand-primary); filter: blur(35px); opacity: 0.2; pointer-events: none;"></div>
                <div style="font-size: 0.55rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--brand-primary); text-align: left;">01 / 05</div>
                
                <div style="text-align: left;">
                  <div style="font-size: 0.65rem; color: #8E8E99; font-weight: 500;">Estrategia visual</div>
                  <div style="font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600; color: #ffffff; line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 4px; font-family: 'Lexend', sans-serif;">El diseño genérico <span style="background: var(--gradient-primary); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;">devalúa</span> tu precio.</div>
                </div>
                
                <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; z-index: 2;">
                  <span style="font-size: 0.55rem; color: #8E8E99; font-weight: 500;">kaptativa</span>
                  <span style="background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 12px; font-size: 0.5rem; color: #ffffff; font-weight: 600; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px;">
                    Deslizar <span></span>
                  </span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <!-- Action Bar -->
              <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 2px 4px 0 4px;">
                <div style="display: flex; gap: 12px; color: #ffffff; font-size: 0.9rem;">
                  <span style="color: var(--brand-primary); cursor: pointer;"><svg class="glyph" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z"/></svg></span>
                  <span style="cursor: pointer; color: #8E8E99;"><svg class="glyph" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7.9 20A9 9 0 1 0 4 16.1L2 22Z"/></svg></span>
                  <span style="cursor: pointer; color: #8E8E99;"><svg class="glyph" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m22 2-7 20-4-9-9-4Z"/><path d="M22 2 11 13"/></svg></span>
                </div>
                <span style="cursor: pointer; color: #8E8E99; font-size: 0.9rem;"><svg class="glyph" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"/></svg></span>
              </div>
              <!-- Likes & Caption preview -->
              <div style="padding: 0 4px; font-size: 0.65rem; color: #D4D4D9; text-align: left;">
                <div style="font-weight: 600; color: #ffffff; margin-bottom: 2px;">Le gusta a 48 directores y marcas líderes</div>
                <div><strong style="color: #ffffff;">kaptativa</strong> Si vendés servicios high-ticket, tus perfiles digitales no pueden verse como plantillas de Canva de $5... <span style="color: #8E8E99; cursor: pointer;">más</span></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Pilar 3 -->
          <div class="glass-card-premium reveal" style="justify-content: space-between; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
            <div>
              <div class="pillar-icon">
                <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 20h9"></path><path d="M16.5 3.5a2.12 2.12 0 0 1 3 3L7 19l-4 1 1-4Z"></path></svg>
              </div>
              <h3>Copywriting persuasivo</h3>
              <p>Redactamos textos y guiones para Reels/videos cortos que capturan la atención, educan al mercado y despiertan el deseo de compra.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- LinkedIn Post Mockup -->
            <div class="mock-linkedin-widget" style="margin-top: 20px; background: rgba(15, 15, 25, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06); border-radius: 12px; padding: 12px; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; text-align: left;">
              <!-- Header: Profile -->
              <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
                <div style="width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 50%; background: #6A48F5; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 0.7rem; color: #ffffff; font-weight: 600;">K</div>
                <div>
                  <div style="font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 600; color: #ffffff; line-height: 1;">Kaptativa Studio</div>
                  <div style="font-size: 0.55rem; color: #8E8E99; margin-top: 2px;">1.250 seguidores, hace 1 h</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <!-- Copy Structure content -->
              <div style="font-size: 0.7rem; color: #ffffff; line-height: 1.4; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;">
                <!-- Hook -->
                <div style="background: rgba(124, 92, 255, 0.04); border-left: 2px solid var(--brand-primary); padding-left: 6px;">
                  <strong style="color: var(--brand-primary);">Gancho:</strong> "No estás perdiendo clientes frente a competidores mejores. Los estás perdiendo frente a marcas con más autoridad digital..."
                </div>
                <!-- Agitation -->
                <div style="color: #ECECEF; padding-left: 8px;">
                  "Muchos directores B2B creen que las redes son solo para influencers. Pero hoy el 82% de las decisiones de compra corporativa inician con una búsqueda del perfil de sus socios..."
                </div>
                <!-- Solution / CTA -->
                <div style="background: rgba(124, 92, 255, 0.04); border-left: 2px solid var(--brand-primary); padding-left: 6px;">
                  <strong style="color: #A08CFF;">Solución y llamado a la acción:</strong> "Construimos el estatus digital que tu ticket merece. Comentá «diagnóstico» abajo y te enviamos una auditoría de tus perfiles sin cargo."
                </div>
              </div>
              <!-- Divider -->
              <div style="height: 1px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06); margin: 2px 0;"></div>
              <!-- Interactions & Stats -->
              <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 0.55rem; color: #8E8E99;">
                <span><svg class="glyph" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 10v12"/><path d="M15 5.88 14 10h5.83a2 2 0 0 1 1.92 2.56l-2.33 8A2 2 0 0 1 17.5 22H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2.76a2 2 0 0 0 1.79-1.11L12 2a3.13 3.13 0 0 1 3 3.88Z"/></svg> 24 reacciones, 5 comentarios</span>
                <span>3 compartidos</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Pilar 4 -->
          <div class="glass-card-premium reveal">
            <div class="pillar-icon">
              <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="18" y1="20" x2="18" y2="10"></line><line x1="12" y1="20" x2="12" y2="4"></line><line x1="6" y1="20" x2="6" y2="14"></line></svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Publicación y reporte</h3>
            <p>Gestionamos la publicación consistente en tus canales y entregamos informes de métricas reales de negocio (leads y consultas calificadas).</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- APLICACIONES POR RUBRO / SECTOR -->
    <section class="section section-rubros section-light" id="rubros">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header reveal" style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 50px;">
          <h2>Estrategias alineadas a tu nicho de mercado</h2>
          <p style="max-width: 750px; margin: 0 auto; color: var(--text-secondary);">Diseñamos y planificamos la estrategia según la lógica comercial de tu sector para asegurar el máximo retorno.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="rubros-grid reveal">
          <!-- Tarjeta 1 -->
          <div class="rubro-card">
            <div class="card-header-row">
              <div class="card-header-left">
                <div class="rubro-icon-wrapper wrapper-emerald">
                  <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"></path><polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"></polyline></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Inmobiliarias y corredores</h3>
              </div>
              <svg class="card-chevron" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
            </div>
            <p>Estrategias en Instagram y YouTube mostrando propiedades en video de alta calidad para generar confianza y captar inversores.</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Tarjeta 2 -->
          <div class="rubro-card">
            <div class="card-header-row">
              <div class="card-header-left">
                <div class="rubro-icon-wrapper wrapper-purple">
                  <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="7" width="20" height="14" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M16 21V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16"></path></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Servicios B2B y consultoras</h3>
              </div>
              <svg class="card-chevron" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
            </div>
            <p>Posicionamiento de marca personal en LinkedIn para directores y socios, atrayendo leads corporativos de alto valor.</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Tarjeta 3 -->
          <div class="rubro-card">
            <div class="card-header-row">
              <div class="card-header-left">
                <div class="rubro-icon-wrapper wrapper-orange">
                  <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 2L3 6v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6l-3-4z"></path><line x1="3" y1="6" x2="21" y2="6"></line><path d="M16 10a4 4 0 0 1-8 0"></path></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>E-commerce y tiendas</h3>
              </div>
              <svg class="card-chevron" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
            </div>
            <p>Estrategias visuales en Instagram Reels y TikTok mostrando el producto en uso, impulsando la compra directa.</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Tarjeta 4 -->
          <div class="rubro-card">
            <div class="card-header-row">
              <div class="card-header-left">
                <div class="rubro-icon-wrapper wrapper-crimson">
